---
import SectionWrapper from "./SectionWrapper.astro";
---

<SectionWrapper id="about" aria-label="About me">
  <!-- Mobile Header -->
  <div
    class="sticky top-0 z-20 -mx-6 mb-4 w-screen bg-slate-900/75 px-6 py-5 backdrop-blur md:-mx-12 md:px-12 lg:sr-only lg:relative lg:top-auto lg:mx-auto lg:w-full lg:px-0 lg:py-0 lg:opacity-0"
  >
    <h2
      class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-200 lg:sr-only"
    >
      About
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="text-slate-400 space-y-4">
    <!-- Credentials -->
    <p>
      Welcome to my personal website! I'm a software engineer based out of
      <b class="text-slate-200"> Houston, Texas</b>. I'm also a University of
      Houston graduate with a B.S. in Computer Science.
    </p>
    <!-- Currently Pursuing -->
    <p>
      I have foundations in full-stack web applications with a growing passion
      for infrastructure, automation, and developer tools. I've previously
      worked in the healthcare, data analytics, and automation industry. I'm
      currently learning how to use cloud technologies such as Azure and DevOps
      best practices.
    </p>
    <!-- Hobby  -->
    <p>
      When I'm not on my computer, you can find me at the gym, running, or
      planning my next adventure. I also love to tinker and fix secondhand
      items! I'm curious how things work behind the scenes, and have fixed many
      household electronics and even worked on small engines like generators!
    </p>
  </div>
</SectionWrapper>
